  'draft', 'advanced',
  $x$A 42-year-old woman with Behçet's disease (recurrent oral and genital ulcers, biopsy-confirmed) develops recurrent episodes of retinal vasculitis and hypopyon uveitis affecting both eyes, with visual acuity declining to 6/24 in the worse eye despite maintenance azathioprine and low-dose prednisolone. She has had 3 sight-threatening flares in the past year.$x$,
  'What is the most appropriate next step in management?',
  array[$x$Behcet's uveitis$x$,'retinal vasculitis','biologic therapy escalation']
),
